 "if2": {
  "_doc": "Interface IF2 (Turned Court keyed / ring variants). A tube collar on top of each pedestal enters an annular groove under the layer above. Grip comes from in-plane cantilever beams in the groove's outer wall (they flex along the layers, not across them), each with a bump that preloads the collar. A key lug at the back (+Y) makes every joint one-way so the tier dots line up at the front (-Y). Collar sizes differ per tier, so a base cannot sit on a T3.",
